title: "The Cohomological Price of NOT"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yang"
    given-names: "Won Chul"
    email: "wcy0969@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
year: 2026
repository-code: "https://github.com/ycmath/cohomological-price-of-not"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - negation complexity
  - inversion complexity
  - Markov decrease
  - Boolean formulas
  - group cohomology
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
abstract: >
  The decrease invariant d(f) governing negation complexity acquires a
  cohomological address: on the dual-rail four-valued lattice, the character
  chi_sigma of the Klein four-group is the unique character pricing negation,
  and d(f) equals the minimal length of a nested chi_sigma-tower, with an
  explicit three-zone witness for the upper bound. All results are
  machine-verified in core Lean 4 with kernel axioms propext and Quot.sound
  only.
